          "title": "You'll want to know: झोंपड़ी",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "झोंपड़ी — jhõpṛī — \"a hut\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "खेत के पास एक झोंपड़ी है। khet ke pās ek jhõpṛī hai. There is a hut near the field."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "झोंपड़ी (jhõpṛī) goes back to jhuppa, \"a hut\", a form CDIAL reconstructs (CDIAL 5403), which lists Hindi jhõpṛī."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
