              "text": "मकान — makān — \"a house (the building)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हमने किराये पर एक मकान लिया। hamne kirāye par ek makān liyā. We rented a house."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "घर is home; मकान (makān) is the building, the thing you rent, buy or build."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
